Assignment Title: Visual Prompt Studio Phase 2.1
Prompt: Create a silkscreen artwork featuring a brother and sister. The silkscreen should have a strong value of contrast by making the figures brigther and more detailed than the background. Heavy on pastel tones and highlights should draw the viewer's attention directly to the siblings, while the backround remains less detailed. Also use some vertical lines throughout the artwork to symbolize the strength, stability, and resilience. These lines can appear in the background such as in trees, buildings or other things. Add some movement that should communicate that the distractions of the world around them do not matter because they have each other. Also on the silkscreen use cross-hatching to create deep shadows around the outer areas of the artwork. These shadows should symbolize lonlimess and the emotional darkness that could exist if the siblings did not have one another. 
